A Conquistador Titan was used by [[Hernán Cortés]] and was left to guard the conqueror's treasures inside his [[Hernán Cortés' vault|vault]]. {{Source|The Power of Umbra}}

Centuries later, [[Dante Vale]], intent on recovering [[Umbra]]'s [[Ring]], discovered the tomb but was unable to enter its vault due to a magical barrier that could only be disabled by Conquistador from within. {{Source|Gremlow Infestation!}}

The team realized that Conquistador could be charmed into letting them into the vault using the [[Pied Pipe]]. While doing this, [[Wilder]] and his team captured them and Cherit was left to play the pipe. After the two teams began to fight, Cherit dropped the pipe in order that he could help out, leading to Conquistador becoming uncharmed.

Conquistador focused his attacks only on the Huntik team after they recovered Umbra. After defeating both [[Enfluxion]] and [[Kaioh the Tracker]], Conquistador advanced on the Huntik team. As a final resort, Dante used Umbra's power to teleport safely away from Conquistador's clutches. {{Source|The Power of Umbra}}
